Hi,

an important note to all users of SVN versions: I have now finally moved the 
KDE 4 version of rkward to "trunk". The previous trunk is now located at 
https://rkward.svn.sourceforge.net/svnroot/rkward/branches/release_branch_0.4.9 .

If you have been following the trunk, and want to do the switch to the KDE 4 
versions now, all you need to do is

# svn up

If you have been following the trunk, and want to stick with the KDE 3 version 
of rkward for the time being, run (in the top directory of your working 
copy):

# svn switch 
https://rkward.svn.sourceforge.net/svnroot/rkward/branches/release_branch_0.4.9
# svn up

If you have already been following the KDE 4 branch, you will now want to 
switch to trunk, using (in the top directory of your working copy):

# svn switch https://rkward.svn.sourceforge.net/svnroot/rkward/trunk/rkward
# svn up

Regards
Thomas

P.S.: I'll try to prepare a preview release of 0.4.9 today, and will give some 
information on the expected timeline, then.
